silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_15_ologs_concrete_anchor#paper15ologgrowth silm:hasLongDescription "The Paper15OlogGrowth is the olog construction process from paper 15. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Paper 15 olog growth', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
